{"version":1,"content":"<p>踏入新皇崗口岸開通後第二個周末，入境處表示，目前口岸離境和入境大堂整體十分暢順，料未來北上和南下人流會逐漸上升。</p><p>入境處於5樓離境層新增合作查驗e-道登記站，入境處長郭俊峯及副處長程和木亦有到口岸視察，了解登記站的運作及登記流程。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:28.146658+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.794893+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:10.991895+00:00","content_hash":"b7369b2b17ce2749b76c9ba314b45adccca18b2480ae3c28f1a0aba1c1d3272e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}